            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<b>Perch for Mac</b>

<li><b>The notch no longer gets in the way of browser tabs.</b> By default Perch now opens when you rest the pointer on the notch for a moment. Passing over it, sliding along a full-screen app's tabs, or clicking something under it no longer opens it.</li>
<li><b>Choose how Perch opens</b> in Settings › General: pause on the notch, touch the notch, click the notch, or keyboard only (⌥N).</li>
<li><b>Money › Transactions fits the panel again:</b> filters on one row, totals and categories above the list. The statement review's lines fit as well.</li>

]]></description>
